Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [seeed r100x V1.1 board specific]

reComputer R100x V1.1 wires the mini-PCIE2 LoRa module to SPI1 (GPIO17-21),
so the packet forwarder talks to /dev/spidev1.1 (CE1). V1.0 boards keep the
upstream default path with the ",uart2" dtoverlay parameter (SPI0, spidev0.1).

--- a/packet_forwarder/global_conf.json.sx1250.EU868
+++ b/packet_forwarder/global_conf.json.sx1250.EU868
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 {
     "SX130x_conf": {
         "com_type": "SPI",
-        "com_path": "/dev/spidev0.0",
+        "com_path": "/dev/spidev1.1",
         "lorawan_public": true,
         "clksrc": 0,
         "antenna_gain": 0, /* antenna gain, in dBi */
